              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awi wod dhano, wac ri Joisiraili ni lowo pajo koc, aka koth k'ocwe i iye i ndelo ma nge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riwirok pa jotuci wac Were mere cal simbwore ma johola kwoŋ ogwaŋ ma joneko. Joneko ji aka jonyaga pesa kodi lim ma jonyalo nwaŋo, aka gi neki pajo joweyo mon kweth ma bu cwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.10.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 10:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jocway ri Were i wi migam mere joturo cik paran aka jokiwor gimaleŋ. Jokikethi pokirok i dier leŋo kodi gima kileŋ. Jokifonji pokirok i dier gim'olony kodi gimakoc, aka jokoco sabato paran, ŋey kiworan i dier jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jodhum mere jocale paka arare ma joyeco ogwaŋ ma joneko. Joneko ŋey jowoŋaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jotuci wac Were mere jofuyo gimatar rijo, aka joneno twodo, jothiedho rijo gima k'obedo adieri, aka jowaco ni, Rwoth waco ama; ma Rwoth fodi k'oluwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji ma lowo jotimo akor aka jokwalo, jotieko diyo jocandi kodi ji ma bu gimoro, aka jotieko tero jopath marac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arango i dier jo dhano manyalo geto kendo kor ot, ŋata nyalo cungo kama kor ot obar'iye to kwonga lowo ka nge paran cegin reyo woko, to akinyalo nwaŋo dhano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno atieko konjo nge paran kwoŋ jo, gi mac ma keme. Atieko reyo woko jo, ro tim pajo, atieko miyo jo gir'acula, Rwoth Were waco.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
